8dfcd-fcd2-4197-9374-d570fd512f6d\",\"warnings\":[]},\"start_char\":0,\"tables\":[],\"text\":\"# 订单服务需求\\r\\n\\r\\n## 订单保留\\r\\n已支付订单保留7天，超过保留期查询返回410。\\r\\n\\r\\n## 优惠码\\r\\n提交有效优惠码PROMO5时订单金额减少5元。\\r\\n\\r\\n## 管理鉴权\\r\\n未登录访问GET /admin必须返回401，不得创建登录前置。\\r\\n\"},{\"blocks\":[{\"end_char\":46,\"heading_level\":null,\"id\":\"block-3\",\"kind\":\"text\",\"source\":{\"end_line\":4,\"kind\":\"line\",\"page\":null,\"part\":null,\"path\":[],\"start_line\":4},\"start_char\":21},{\"end_char\":56,\"heading_level\":2,\"id\":\"block-4\",\"kind\":\"heading\",\"source\":{\"end_line\":6,\"kind\":\"line\",\"page\":null,\"part\":null,\"path\":[],\"start_line\":6},\"start_char\":48},{\"end_char\":81,\"heading_level\":null,\"id\":\"block-5\",\"kind\":\"text\",\"source\":{\"end_line\":7,\"kind\":\"line\",\"page\":null,\"part\":null,\"path\":[],\"start_line\":7},\"start_char\":56}],\"end_char\":83,\"sections\":[{\"end_char\":126,\"heading_block_id\":\"block-1\",\"id\":\"section-1\",\"level\":1,\"parent_id\":null,\"start_char\":0,\"title\":\"订单服务需求\"},{\"end_char\":48,\"heading_block_id\":\"block-2\",\"id\":\"section-2\",\"level\":2,\"parent_id\":\"section-1\",\"start_char\":12,\"title\":\"订单保留\"},{\"end_char\":83,\"heading_block_id\":\"block-4\",\"id\":\"section-3\",\"level\":2,\"parent_id\":\"section-1\",\"start_char\":48,\"title\":\"优惠码\"}],\"source\":{\"asset_id\":\"9f288ff2-0ee1-4a42-ac39-8a7a7a75f63f\",\"document_id\":\"6a504b41-270a-57ea-a43f-f926c3808fb4\",\"id\":\"parse:e3fd5441-b263-46a7-825a-ef5cffe23210\",\"length_chars\":126,\"original_sha256\":\"7acb94760bac15c53bd7df52c5acaa0773fbbeb75d0e119d87aa8a10848fa792\",\"roles\":[\"old\",\"original:6a504b41-270a-57ea-a43f-f926c3808fb4:0618dfcd-fcd2-4197-9374-d570fd512f6d:9f288ff2-0ee1-4a42-ac39-8a7a7a75f63f:e3fd5441-b263-46a7-825a-ef5cffe23210\"],\"snapshot_id\":\"e3fd5441-b263-46a7-825a-ef5cffe23210\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"text_sha256\":\"7acb94760bac15c53bd7df52c5acaa0773fbbeb75d0e119d87aa8a10848fa792\",\"version_id\":\"0618dfcd-fcd2-4197-9374-d570fd512f6d\",\"warnings\":[]},\"start_char\":21,\"tables\":[],\"text\":\"已支付订单保留7天，超过保留期查询返回410。\\r\\n\\r\\n## 优惠码\\r\\n提交有效优惠码PROMO5时订单金额减少5元。\\r\\n\\r\\n\"},{\"blocks\":[{\"end_char\":46,\"heading_level\":null,\"id\":\"block-3\",\"kind\":\"text\",\"source\":{\"end_line\":4,\"kind\":\"line\",\"page\":null,\"part\":null,\"path\":[],\"start_line\":4},\"start_char\":21}],\"end_char\":46,\"sections\":[{\"end_char\":139,\"heading_block_id\":\"block-1\",\"id\":\"section-1\",\"level\":1,\"parent_id\":null,\"start_char\":0,\"title\":\"订单服务需求\"},{\"end_char\":48,\"heading_block_id\":\"block-2\",\"id\":\"section-2\",\"level\":2,\"parent_id\":\"section-1\",\"start_char\":12,\"title\":\"订单保留\"}],\"source\":{\"asset_id\":\"09685e54-1502-4bbe-ae4e-df68710236f7\",\"document_id\":\"6a504b41-270a-57ea-a43f-f926c3808fb4\",\"id\":\"parse:7b5cea92-46d4-4832-935d-c65f79841f93\",\"length_chars\":139,\"original_sha256\":\"bf3109a4a4dfd159cb678b663510ad35b58546b7f99d884b31f1f545642a99f9\",\"roles\":[\"new\"],\"snapshot_id\":\"7b5cea92-46d4-4832-935d-c65f79841f93\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"text_sha256\":\"bf3109a4a4dfd159cb678b663510ad35b58546b7f99d884b31f1f545642a99f9\",\"version_id\":\"013cda88-0ecd-487b-a620-55e62a164d15\",\"warnings\":[]},\"start_char\":21,\"tables\":[],\"text\":\"已支付订单保留9天，超过保留期查询返回410。\\r\\n\"},{\"blocks\":[{\"end_char\":102,\"heading_level\":2,\"id\":\"block-6\",\"kind\":\"heading\",\"source\":{\"end_line\":9,\"kind\":\"line\",\"page\":null,\"part\":null,\"path\":[],\"start_line\":9},\"start_char\":93},{\"end_char\":139,\"heading_level\":null,\"id\":\"block-7\",\"kind\":\"text\",\"source\":{\"end_line\":10,\"kind\":\"line\",\"page\":null,\"part\":null,\"path\":[],\"start_line\":10},\"start_char\":102}],\"end_char\":139,\"sections\":[{\"end_char\":139,\"heading_block_id\":\"block-1\",\"id\":\"section-1\",\"level\":1,\"parent_id\":null,\"start_char\":0,\"title\":\"订单服务需求\"},{\"end_char\":93,\"heading_block_id\":\"block-4\",\"id\":\"section-3\",\"level\":2,\"parent_id\":\"section-1\",\"start_char\":48,\"title\":\"管理鉴权\"},{\"end_char\":139,\"heading_block_id\":\"block-6\",\"id\":\"section-4\",\"level\":2,\"parent_id\":\"section-1\",\"start_char\":93,\"title\":\"订单导出\"}],\"source\":{\"asset_id\":\"09685e54-1502-4bbe-ae4e-df68710236f7\",\"document_id\":\"6a504b41-270a-57ea-a43f-f926c3808fb4\",\"id\":\"parse:7b5cea92-46d4-4832-935d-c65f79841f93\",\"length_chars\":139,\"original_sha256\":\"bf3109a4a4dfd159cb678b663510ad35b58546b7f99d884b31f1f545642a99f9\",\"roles\":[\"new\"],\"snapshot_id\":\"7b5cea92-46d4-4832-935d-c65f79841f93\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"text_sha256\":\"bf3109a4a4dfd159cb678b663510ad35b58546b7f99d884b31f1f545642a99f9\",\"version_id\":\"013cda88-0ecd-487b-a620-55e62a164d15\",\"warnings\":[]},\"start_char\":91,\"tables\":[],\"text\":\"\\r\\n## 订单导出\\r\\n新增GET /orders/export，导出订单按创建时间倒序排列。\\r\\n\"}],\"analysis_protocol\":{\"instruction\":\"Return one impact-response-v5 JSON object. Follow the current coordination stage. For finish, unit_outcome must be analyzed or evidence_insufficient, never null, and reads empty. Discovery: read every frozen discovery_task member, propose one set of rule changes with T refs from fixed_text_evidence; return evidence_outcomes in fixed P/D member order with a specific outcome/reason for every member. Never infer unread evidence was analyzed. Discovery has no case impacts. Case stage: assess every R rule for the current complete case identified by primary_ref, using its entire JSON, execution_notes, original sources and rule evidence. Return rule_ref/case_impacts for that current case; evidence_outcomes is empty. Other cases may be read as supplementary evidence, but each has its own analysis task; do not turn this call into whole-project coverage. Case citations are F strings from fixed_case_evidence for the stated case_ref. Each F selects a literal field path in the complete JSON or execution_notes; values are already in those complete reads. Do not output paths, values, UUIDs or hashes. Case metadata titles are not content_json fields. The server binds T/F selections to exact original positions/versions/paths/values and verifies them. For read request only needed fixed P/S/C/D reads with no candidates, evidence_outcomes or outcome. Other catalogs are retrieval metadata, not supplied evidence. Preserve deliberate negative conditions. Report missing evidence explicitly. All proposals pending review, deployment unknown. Do not execute tests or change official records.\",\"response_schema\":{\"$defs\":{\"BoundRangeRead\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"end_char\":{\"minimum\":0,\"title\":\"End Char\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"source_ref\":{\"pattern\":\"^S[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"title\":\"Source Ref\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"start_char\":{\"minimum\":0,\"title\":\"Start Char\",\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"source_ref\",\"start_char\",\"end_char\"],\"title\":\"BoundRangeRead\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundReadRequest\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"case_refs\":{\"items\":{\"pattern\":\"^C[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"title\":\"Case Refs\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"difference_refs\":{\"items\":{\"pattern\":\"^D[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"title\":\"Difference Refs\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"ranges\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundRangeRead\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"title\":\"Ranges\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"segment_refs\":{\"items\":{\"pattern\":\"^P[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"title\":\"Segment Refs\",\"type\":\"array\"}},\"title\":\"BoundReadRequest\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"CaseAnchoredCandidate\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"case_ref\":{\"pattern\":\"^C[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"title\":\"Case Ref\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"citations\":{\"items\":{\"pattern\":\"^F[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"minItems\":1,\"title\":\"Citations\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"level\":{\"enum\":[\"none\",\"minor\",\"major\",\"uncer